{"id":425,"title":"挑战5: 带乘法的嵌套循环（中等）","summary":" 一个更复杂的练习，其中涉及嵌套循环，循环变量随着每次乘法而增加。  \n\n","tags":"","components":[{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"d071249f-e630-4c3e-a43c-5d7238252555","text":"## 问题\n\n计算下面的代码的复杂度。最好先在一张纸上解决，然后对比答案是否正确。\n\n### 代码","text_html":"<h2>问题</h2>\n<p>计算下面的代码的复杂度。最好先在一张纸上解决，然后对比答案是否正确。</p>\n<h3>代码</h3>\n","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"view","step":0},{"type":"Code","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"b2b3c1c4-a164-4ccb-a511-b6ff5b1516ce","title":"","caption":"","language":"python3","special_input":"no-input","entry_file_name":"main.py","content":"n = 10  # n 可以为任意值\nsum = 0\npie = 3.14\nfor var in range(1, n, 3):\n    j = 1\n    print(pie)\n    while j < n:\n        sum += 1\n        j *= 3\nprint(sum)  # O(1)\n","time_limit":30,"allow_download":false,"read_only":false,"high_lighted_lines":"","runnable":true,"judge":false,"judge_content_prepend":"\n\n\n","show_solution":false,"solution_content":"\n\n\n","additional_content":[],"hidden_code_content":{"prepend_code":"\n\n","append_code":"\n\n","code_selection":"prependCode"},"judge_content":null,"judge_hints":null,"learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"edit","step":1},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"4018f15d-e332-4447-b6a0-aa92bd81835b","text":"回答以下问题，看看你的结果是否符合正确答案。","text_html":"<p>回答以下问题，看看你的结果是否符合正确答案。</p>\n","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"view","step":2},{"type":"Quiz","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"7b82cbec-e39d-4cb9-88db-58047ba6e16c","title":"","title_html":"","render_mode":"slide","questions":[{"question_id":190,"question_type":"single_choice","question_text":"以下哪项最能表示上面写的程序的Big(O)复杂度？","question_text_html":"<p>以下哪项最能表示上面写的程序的Big(O)复杂度？</p>\n","question_options":[{"text":"$O(n)$\n","text_html":"<p><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-ht